          <id>22</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>BankFeed connection will be created for the bank if it is specified. Otherwise, the connection will be created for the bank account</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>اگر بانک مشخص شده باشد، اتصال BankFeed برای بانک ایجاد می‌شود. در غیر این صورت، اتصال برای حساب بانکی ایجاد می‌شود</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>BankFeed подключение будет создано для банка, если банк указан. Подключение будет создано для банковского счета в противном случае</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Banka belirtilmişse banka için BankFeed bağlantısı oluşturulacaktır. Aksi takdirde banka hesabı için bağlantı oluşturulacaktır</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>BankFeed kết nối sẽ được tạo cho ngân hàng, nếu đã chỉ định ngân hàng. Nếu không thì sẽ tạo kết nối cho tài khoản ngân hàng</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>BankFeed connection will be created for the bank if it is specified. Otherwise, the connection will be created for the bank account</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>BankFeed connection will be created for the bank if it is specified. Otherwise, the connection will be created for the bank account</value>
          </title>
